1
00:00:03,333 --> 00:00:06,167
You're probably wondering
why I asked you to come.

2
00:00:06,167 --> 00:00:11,333
[PLAYFUL ROMANTIC MUSIC PLAYING]

3
00:00:11,333 --> 00:00:12,400
Here.

4
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:22,167
[RIBBON RUSTLING]

5
00:00:22,167 --> 00:00:23,233
[GIFT OPENS]

6
00:00:24,533 --> 00:00:31,500
[MELANCHOLIC MUSIC PLAYING]

7
00:00:38,633 --> 00:00:40,133
- [RIBBON RUSTLING]
- [GIFT CLOSES LOUDLY]

8
00:00:40,133 --> 00:00:41,333
Wait a second, what's this?

9
00:00:41,333 --> 00:00:42,467
A bribe?

10
00:00:42,467 --> 00:00:44,467
You think I'll forget about it
with just one gift?

11
00:00:45,133 --> 00:00:46,533
I want to offer you a job.

12
00:00:46,533 --> 00:00:49,267
[QUIRKY MUSIC PLAYING]

13
00:00:49,267 --> 00:00:51,500
Be my Tagalog translator
and guide.

14
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:53,267
I'll pay you 50,000 pesos
a month.

15
00:00:53,267 --> 00:00:54,733
- [CASH REGISTER SFX]
- [GASPS]

16
00:00:57,500 --> 00:00:58,667
Sorry, sorry.

17
00:00:59,167 --> 00:01:02,100
Calm down. Calm down, self.

18
00:01:04,467 --> 00:01:05,567
[CLEARS THROAT]

19
00:01:06,367 --> 00:01:07,433
Sir,

20
00:01:07,467 --> 00:01:09,333
you're asking me to do two jobs.

21
00:01:09,333 --> 00:01:11,033
You know, two jobs.

22
00:01:11,633 --> 00:01:13,200
Seventy thousand.

23
00:01:13,200 --> 00:01:18,433
[QUIRKY MUSIC CONTINUES]

24
00:01:18,433 --> 00:01:19,600
Sixty thousand.

25
00:01:20,167 --> 00:01:21,533
Take it or leave it.

26
00:01:22,167 --> 00:01:24,500
Sixty-five thousand.

27
00:01:25,200 --> 00:01:26,700
And I'm yours.

28
00:01:28,533 --> 00:01:29,733
Kpaps?

29
00:01:29,733 --> 00:01:31,067
[DING SFX]

30
00:01:31,067 --> 00:01:36,333
[CHEERFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

31
00:01:36,333 --> 00:01:37,367
Deal.

32
00:01:37,700 --> 00:01:38,700
Deal?

33
00:01:41,500 --> 00:01:43,867
Deal! Yes! Deal! [THUDS]

34
00:01:43,867 --> 00:01:47,367
Yes! Yes! Wooh! [CLAPS]

35
00:01:47,367 --> 00:01:50,567
[SINGSONG] Sixty-five thousand!

36
00:01:50,567 --> 00:01:56,367
Every month! Yes!
Yes! Wooh! Yes! [CLAPS]

37
00:01:56,800 --> 00:01:59,600
Oh, I'm telling you!

38
00:01:59,600 --> 00:02:01,533
You won't regret it, Kpaps!

39
00:02:01,533 --> 00:02:04,500
I'll give it my all.
I'll do my absolute best!

40
00:02:04,500 --> 00:02:07,400
To the point
you'll never let me go.

41
00:02:07,600 --> 00:02:09,700
No, no, no, no. [CLAPS]

42
00:02:09,700 --> 00:02:12,267
Yes, yes! Nice, nice!
Very good, very good! [CLAPS]

43
00:02:15,333 --> 00:02:16,867
Let's get down to business.

44
00:02:17,300 --> 00:02:18,300
Bring it on!

45
00:02:20,833 --> 00:02:22,400
Take off your clothes.

46
00:02:22,400 --> 00:02:23,733
- [SUSPENSEFUL STING]
- Huh?

47
00:02:24,367 --> 00:02:25,667
Sir, what?

48
00:02:25,667 --> 00:02:27,900
[PLAYFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

49
00:02:27,900 --> 00:02:29,667
I said, take off your clothes.

50
00:02:33,500 --> 00:02:34,533
Now.

51
00:02:34,533 --> 00:02:41,500
[PLAYFUL MUSIC CONTINUES]
